# Normalise line endings.
#
# Without this, a contributor on Windows commits CRLF and every file they touch shows as
# entirely rewritten in the diff : which makes review impossible and buries real changes. Text
# is stored LF in the repository and checked out native.
#
# Set before the first commit deliberately: fixing it later means one enormous whitespace commit
# that breaks `git blame` for the whole codebase.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated, and noisy in review.
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true -diff

# Binary : never diff or merge these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
